s active, final blows refund ammo."},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Shot Swap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ea9fceb6c5d83d5f6f0ccdbe47ce13db.png","desc":"Final blows build and store charges which allow you to swap and stow this weapon at a faster rate."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Iron Reach","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f732d5d48bf1a9bb6a33aba905af9347.png","desc":"Massively improves weapon range at the cost of weapon stability.","s":{"155624089":-20,"1240592695":20}},{"name":"Killing Wind","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/db2aa71ff6d808929bb0e668dcf0822e.png","desc":"Final blows grant increased mobility, weapon range, and handling for a short duration."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Swashbuckler","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/42631a4aff4432e794529a5a707eba61.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage from melee kills and kills with this weapon."},{"name":"Harmony","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a3c1c5e1cb05adef7cf6af6602a0da0.png","desc":"Final blows with other weapons improve this weapon's damage and performance for a short duration."},{"name":"Eye of the Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f4755f9068959b26b8829641e5725ad.png","desc":"This weapon becomes more accurate and boosts handling as your health gets lower."},{"name":"Adagio","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b344c34bf750a840b24ff5d2f8fe4507.png","desc":"After defeating a target, this weapon fires, charges, or draws more slowly and deals increased damage for a brief time."},{"name":"Fragile Focus","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3d2e945cc3d38e88c87ee3e2687b612a.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus range until your shield is destroyed. The bonus returns once your shield has regenerated to full strength."},{"name":"Opening Shot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/276e8ce23910c6ee2a6b88b076a2004c.png","desc":"Improved accuracy and range on the opening shot of attack."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Skulking Wolf","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/451e0f091bd3e7245a82e4efc01ad8c3.png","desc":"While at low health, final blows with this weapon grant enhanced radar, remove you from opposing Guardians' radar, and make combatants less aggressive toward you."}]}],"notes":["pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"Riiswalker lost Shot Swap and gained Threat Remover.\" Recommended MW: Reload Speed.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB / Controller): \"Riiswalker lost Shot Swap and gained Threat Remover.\" Recommended MW: Range.","pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"Riiswalker is an interesting weapon. A Fallen-forged weapon that can be used against the Fallen. Oh how the turns have tabled. Discord and Vorpal Weapon are going to be my top picks for keeping your magazine loaded and for extra damage against majors. It will not be better than more defined picks, but it will be strong in less focused strikes and low-end PvE.\" Recommended MW: Reload.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB / Controller): \"If you never grinded out your Wastelander patterns like me, this could be your next best option. Riiswalker was always my favorite lightweight shotgun and this version comes with the same great stat package with a potential 100 range. The one thing that separated it from Wastelander was the lack of Opening Shot, this version comes with Opening Shot, and Slideshot for the coveted 100 range. With all the investments into range your barrel and masterwork should be geared towards handling.\" Recommended MW: Range or Handling.","Speedrunner's Shopping List: Pellet swapping (good for: King's Fall)","[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Range] \"Iron Reach is the main draw to Riiswalker, which gives it an enormous +18 Range. You have a variety of good options in Quickdraw/Surplus, if you're someone who exclusively hip-fires, then Hip-Fire Grip is pretty strong too. Firmly Planted works mid-slide, so is more-or-less an ape's best friend.\"","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: pvp)","illPhysics (PvP): A-Tier (Strong). Recommended MW: Range / Handling.","Sharditkeepit Community - PVE recommended roll","sharditkeepit Community - PVP recommended roll - Hip-Fire Grip for MKB and Slideways for Controller"],"craftable":false,"sources":["Complete Iron Banner matches and earn rank-up packages from Lord Saladin.","Random Perks: This item cannot be reacquired from Collections."],"activities":[],"hash":1764868900,"vendors":["Banshee-44","Ada-1"],"frame":"Lightweight Frame","stats":{"list":[{"h":4284893193,"name":"Rounds Per Minute","max":100,"num":true,"interp":[[0,55],[10,60],[30,65],[40,70],[80,80],[90,90],[100,140]]},{"h":4043523819,"name":"Impact","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[10,65],[70,70],[100,85]]},{"h":1240592695,"name":"Range","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]